Built this as a small set of files (shown as code blocks only — per your instructions I haven't written anything to disk). It follows Telegram Mini App conventions: Telegram's **BackButton** handles "back to cart" (no in-page arrow), the **MainButton** is the Pay button (disabled while the form is invalid, shows a progress spinner while paying), colors come from `--tg-theme-*` so it matches light/dark automatically, and it respects safe-area insets, closing confirmation while the form is dirty, and disables vertical swipes while the form scrolls. A plain-CSS fallback back-link/Pay button renders only when it's *not* running inside Telegram, so it's still usable in a normal browser during development.

