A few things worth knowing before you wire this in:
- `onPay` is where you'd call your backend/Telegram payment flow — throwing from it shows `submitError` and resets the MainButton.
- Swap `deliveryFee` for whatever your pricing logic computes.
- The ambient `telegram-web-app.d.ts` only needs to exist once per project even if you add more Mini App screens later.
